content.text:
The first Town Hall you place founds your kingdom, as long as the 64 blocks around it are free of other cities. If you belonged to a faction, you leave it. You receive:
- a faction of your own, “(your name) Kingdom”, which you can rename with /awkingdom rename;
- a capital city around the Town Hall, with a random name (rename it with /awkingdom cityname);
- a Governor beside the Town Hall: the ruler of the city, with whom you manage the kingdom;
- a culture: the look, soldiers, dialogues and natural rivals of an existing faction (the Empire at first), which you can change at the Governor.
Your kingdom starts at peace with every faction, except the eternal enemies that are hostile to its culture, with a truce of 10 days. During these days nobody can attack your capital. You may declare war during the truce, but that ends the protection of your capital for good.
